# beat-c zero-C bail=709 哨兵 (front-end 族, docs/beat-c-zero-c-clearing-queue-2026-07-04.md 序11)
# RED bail=709 (前端不切分单行分号复合语句)
# 根: for 循环体内一行 `a = i; b = 2; break` → typed_expr:20062 判行含 `=` →
#     parser.ParserAppendAssignStmtExprsLine 只取首个 top-level `=`, rhsText 吞掉
#     "i; b = 2; break" 整条尾巴 → 后端对含分号 RHS lower 失败 rhsNodeIndex<0
#     → assignDetail=709 poison。子语句 b=2 / break 丢弃。
# fix: typed_expr:~20053 派发前对 bodyRaw 做 top-level `;` 分段 (落点 B)
# 验证: ZC_DRIVER=artifacts/backend_driver/cheng tools/zc_enumerate.sh <此文件>
#
fn F(x: int32): int32 =
    var a: int32 = -1
    var b: int32 = -1
    for i in 0..<x:
        a = i; b = 2; break
    return a + b
